        '0.17': 'Hearing the monkey\'s words and looking in every direction and intermediate direction, Sita felt supreme joy, remembering Rama with her whole being.',
        '0.18': 'Looking sideways, upward and downward, she saw that one of inconceivable intelligence, the minister of the lord of tawny monkeys, the son of the Wind, like the sun on the eastern mountain.',
