        '0.26': '"But I quickly set out ahead of him, to live in the forest; for parted from him, even dwelling in heaven does not please me.',
        '0.27': '"And even before that, the fortunate Saumitri, delight of his friends, adorned himself in kusha grass and bark to follow his elder brother.',
